"""
research_repro.py

A research module that extends scipy, statsmodels, and pandas with
reproducibility features, experiment tracking, and scientific metadata
handling that the base libraries lack.

Features:
    - Deterministic seed management across numpy/scipy/random/statsmodels
    - Experiment tracking with run metadata, parameters, metrics, artifacts
    - Scientific metadata attachment to pandas DataFrames (provenance,
      units, citations) via a custom accessor
    - Reproducible wrappers around scipy.stats tests and statsmodels
      model fitting that automatically log inputs/outputs/environment
    - Content-hash based caching of expensive computations
    - Exportable, human-readable run reports (JSON / Markdown)
